<title>USA: Unisys Lutz to join Compaq.</title>
<headline>Unisys Lutz to join Compaq.</headline>
<dateline>BLUE BELL, Pa. 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unisys Corp said Alan Lutz, an executive vice president and president of its Computer Systems Group, has accepted a position with Compaq Computer Corp, as senior vice president and general manager of a new Communications Products Group.</p>
<p>Lutz will report to Compaq chief executive Eckhard Pfeiffer, according to Unisys.</p>
<p>Unisys said a new president for its Computer Systems Group would be appointed in the near future.</p>
</text>
